{"event": "http_response", "method": "GET", "url": "https://www.alphavantage.co/query", "status": 200, "elapsed_ms": 556, "attempt": 1, "response_body": "{\n    \"items\": \"50\",\n    \"sentiment_score_definition\": \"x <= -0.35: Bearish; -0.35 < x <= -0.15: Somewhat-Bearish; -0.15 < x < 0.15: Neutral; 0.15 <= x < 0.35: Somewhat_Bullish; x >= 0.35: Bullish\",\n    \"relevance_score_definition\": \"0 < x <= 1, with a higher score indicating higher relevance.\",\n    \"feed\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Baxter International (NYSE:BAX) Stock Crosses Above 200-Day Moving Average - Here's Why\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/baxter-international-nysebax-stock-crosses-above-200-day-moving-average-heres-why-2026-08-11/\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T060328\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"MarketBeat\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"Baxter International (NYSE:BAX) stock recently crossed above its 200-day moving average, trading at $27.84, significantly higher than its average of $19.93. The company reported strong quarterly earnings, exceeding analyst expectations with an adjusted EPS of $0.56 and revenue of $2.96 billion. Despite positive financial performance and analyst price target increases, the stock maintains a consensus \\\"Reduce\\\" rating with an average target of $22.45, while institutional investors hold a substantial 90.2% of outstanding shares.\",\n            \"banner_image\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/baxter-international-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg\",\n            \"source\": \"MarketBeat\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"MarketBeat\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"earnings\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.932090\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.848491\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"life_sciences\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.717285\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.312032,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"BAX\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.328133\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"American Outdoor Brands (AOUT): Hallador group reports near-10% stake and board seat\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/AOUT/schedule-13d-a-american-outdoor-brands-inc-amended-major-shareholder--dc109c70cca8.html\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T054410\",\n            \"authors\": [],\n            \"summary\": \"Hallador Investment Advisors, along with related funds and three principals, has filed an amended Schedule 13D, reporting a beneficial ownership of 9.45% in American Outdoor Brands (AOUT). The group believes the shares were undervalued and may adjust their position, having recently secured a board seat for Kevin Leary, who was appointed as an independent director on August 4, 2026. This move suggests potential ongoing discussions with management and the board to enhance shareholder value.\",\n            \"banner_image\": null,\n            \"source\": \"Stock Titan\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"Stock Titan\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.943421\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"finance\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.710140\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.125228,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Neutral\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"AOUT\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.148120\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Neutral\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Ashland Inc. Updates Board Committee Roles for Newly Appointed Directors Spizzo and Thomas\",\n            \"url\": \"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/ashland-inc-updates-board-committee-roles-for-newly-appointed-directors-spizzo-and-thomas\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T054309\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"Vinay Lochav\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"Ashland Inc. has announced updates to its Board of Directors' committee assignments for new directors Allen A. Spizzo and Peter T. Thomas, effective August 7, 2026. This information was disclosed in an amended current report filed on August 10, 2026. The article indicates that further details are available upon logging in or creating an account.\",\n            \"banner_image\": \"https://kalkinemedia.com/storage/uploads/large/shutterstock_2765269355_07_02_2026_23_45_45_484072.jpg\",\n            \"source\": \"Kalkine Media\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"Kalkine Media\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"finance\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.840604\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.027741,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Neutral\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"ASH\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.010962\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Neutral\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Agriculture & Natural Solutions Acquisition Corp Releases Q2 2024 10-Q Report\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.tradingview.com/news/tradingview:79021480c293c:0-agriculture-natural-solutions-acquisition-corp-releases-q2-2024-10-q-report/\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T054256\",\n            \"authors\": [],\n            \"summary\": \"Agriculture & Natural Solutions Acquisition Corporation (ANSC) has released its Q2 2024 10-Q report, detailing financial performance including net income of $2.24 million for the quarter. The blank check company, formed to focus on decarbonizing agriculture and enhancing natural capital, completed its IPO in November 2023, raising $345 million. ANSC aims to complete a business combination before November 13, 2025, actively seeking target businesses within its focus areas.\",\n            \"banner_image\": null,\n            \"source\": \"TradingView\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"TradingView\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"earnings\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.947114\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"ipo\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.833658\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"mergers_and_acquisitions\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.724677\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"finance\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.626251\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.281122,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"ANSC\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.277498\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Earnings call transcript: APEI tops Q2 2026 forecasts and lifts outlook\",\n            \"url\": \"https://m.investing.com/news/transcripts/earnings-call-transcript-apei-tops-q2-2026-forecasts-and-lifts-outlook-93CH-4850535?ampMode=1\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T054244\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"Investing.com\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"American Public Education Inc. (APEI) reported stronger-than-expected Q2 2026 results, surpassing revenue and EPS forecasts and subsequently raising its full-year 2026 outlook. The company's revenue increased by 5.5% year-over-year to $171.7 million, with diluted EPS at $0.52, leading to a significant after-hours stock increase. APEI also completed its institutional combination, uniting its academic units under a single accredited institution, and is rolling out an AI-enabled student lifecycle platform to enhance efficiency and student experience.\",\n            \"banner_image\": null,\n            \"source\": \"Investing.com\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"Investing.com\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"earnings\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.902338\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.746828\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.508723,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"APEI\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.618811\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"CRM\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.648208\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.408735\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"AAON: Record sales and earnings growth, with margin improvement expected in Q4 and 2027\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.tradingview.com/news/urn:summary_document_transcript:quartr.com:3998100:0-aaon-record-sales-and-earnings-growth-with-margin-improvement-expected-in-q4-and-2027/\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T054147\",\n            \"authors\": [],\n            \"summary\": \"AAON experienced record sales and earnings growth in Q2, driven by stro", "truncated": true, "ts": "2026-08-11T06:22:36.629416+00:00"}
