{"event": "http_response", "method": "GET", "url": "https://api.marketaux.com/v1/news/all", "status": 200, "elapsed_ms": 409, "attempt": 1, "response_body": "{\"meta\":{\"found\":1,\"returned\":1,\"limit\":3,\"page\":1},\"data\":[{\"uuid\":\"16f99651-0e48-4fb8-8ebd-8a38ffcc4f6d\",\"title\":\"Fortuna acquires highly prospective Bambadji Project in Senegal from Barrick and IAMGOLD\",\"description\":\"VANCOUVER, British Columbia, Aug. 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Fortuna Mining Corp. (NYSE: FSM | TSX: FVI) is pleased to announce the acquisition of the 190 km² Bambadji advanced gold exploration project in Senegal, through the purchase of certain Senegalese subsidiaries held by Barrick Mining Corporation and IAMGOLD Corporation. Located adjacent to Fortuna’s feasibility-stage Diamba Sud Gold Project, Bambadji consolidates approximately 60 kilometers of prospective strike along the Senegal-Mali Shear Zone, a Tier-1 gold corridor hosting several world-class mines.\",\"keywords\":\"Fortuna, acquires, highly, prospective, Bambadji, Project, in, Senegal, from, Barrick, and, IAMGOLD\",\"snippet\":\"VANCOUVER, British Columbia, Aug. 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Fortuna Mining Corp. (NYSE: FSM | TSX: FVI) is pleased to announce the acquisition of the 190 km?...\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.manilatimes.net\\/2026\\/08\\/11\\/tmt-newswire\\/globenewswire\\/fortuna-acquires-highly-prospective-bambadji-project-in-senegal-from-barrick-and-iamgold\\/2402477\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/manilatimes.net\\/manilatimes\\/uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/08\\/11\\/1171457.png\",\"language\":\"en\",\"published_at\":\"2026-08-10T21:51:20.000000Z\",\"source\":\"manilatimes.net\",\"relevance_score\":null,\"entities\":[{\"symbol\":\"IAG\",\"name\":\"IAMGOLD Corporation\",\"exchange\":null,\"exchange_long\":null,\"country\":\"us\",\"type\":\"equity\",\"industry\":\"Basic Materials\",\"match_score\":43.383522,\"sentiment_score\":0.371713,\"highlights\":[{\"highlight\":\"(NYSE: FSM | TSX: FVI) is pleased