{"event": "http_response", "method": "GET", "url": "https://www.alphavantage.co/query", "status": 200, "elapsed_ms": 727, "attempt": 1, "response_body": "{\n    \"items\": \"50\",\n    \"sentiment_score_definition\": \"x <= -0.35: Bearish; -0.35 < x <= -0.15: Somewhat-Bearish; -0.15 < x < 0.15: Neutral; 0.15 <= x < 0.35: Somewhat_Bullish; x >= 0.35: Bullish\",\n    \"relevance_score_definition\": \"0 < x <= 1, with a higher score indicating higher relevance.\",\n    \"feed\": [\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Energy Transfer (ET) director adds 12,359 units, lifting direct and trust holdings\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.stocktitan.net/sec-filings/ET/form-4-energy-transfer-lp-insider-trading-activity-f09514a2400d.html\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T081504\",\n            \"authors\": [],\n            \"summary\": \"Energy Transfer LP director James Richard Perry purchased 12,359.372 Common Units on August 7, 2026, at an average price of $20.2276 per unit. This transaction increased his direct holdings to 208,046 units and indirect holdings through a trust to 24,523 units. The purchase was an open-market or private transaction and was not made under a Rule 10b5-1 trading plan.\",\n            \"banner_image\": null,\n            \"source\": \"Stock Titan\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"Stock Titan\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.900852\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"energy_transportation\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.813613\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.823852,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"ET\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.837453\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"DT Midstream Director Elaine M. Pickle Acquires 1,500 Shares of Common Stock\",\n            \"url\": \"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/dt-midstream-director-elaine-m-pickle-acquires-1500-shares-of-common-stock\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T081341\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"Manish Choudhary\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"DT Midstream Director Elaine M. Pickle recently acquired 1,500 shares of the company's common stock, as disclosed in a Form 4 filing with the SEC. The transaction took place on August 7, 2026. This purchase indicates a director's increased stake in the company.\",\n            \"banner_image\": \"https://kalkinemedia.com/storage/uploads/large/Stockmar_05_11_2026_00_51_12_865957.jpg\",\n            \"source\": \"Kalkine Media\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"Kalkine Media\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"finance\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.844341\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.219767,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"DTM\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.187435\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"24,967 Shares in Medtronic PLC $MDT Acquired by First Bank & Trust\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-24967-shares-in-medtronic-plc-mdt-acquired-by-first-bank-trust-2026-08-11/\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T080551\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"MarketBeat\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"First Bank & Trust recently acquired 24,967 shares of Medtronic PLC (NYSE: MDT), valued at approximately $1.95 million. This purchase is part of a trend of institutional investment, as 82.06% of Medtronic's stock is held by institutional investors. Analysts generally maintain a \\\"Moderate Buy\\\" rating for Medtronic, with an average price target of $98.83, reflecting a positive outlook driven by recent financial performance and strategic collaborations.\",\n            \"banner_image\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/medtronic-inc-logo-1200x675.jpg\",\n            \"source\": \"MarketBeat\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"MarketBeat\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"earnings\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.937150\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.847725\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"life_sciences\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.708789\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.438742,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"MDT\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.401477\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"First Bank & Trust Purchases 41,925 Shares of Kimco Realty Corporation $KIM\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-first-bank-trust-purchases-41925-shares-of-kimco-realty-corporation-kim-2026-08-11/\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T080528\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"MarketBeat\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"First Bank & Trust significantly increased its stake in Kimco Realty Corporation (NYSE:KIM) by 406.9% in the second quarter, acquiring an additional 41,925 shares to bring its total holdings to 52,228 shares valued at approximately $1.324 million. Institutional investors now own 89.25% of Kimco Realty, which has a consensus \\\"Moderate Buy\\\" rating and an average price target of $26.41. The company recently raised its quarterly dividend to $0.28 per share, resulting in a 4.6% yield.\",\n            \"banner_image\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/logos/kimco-realty-corp-logo-1200x675.png?v=20240206085438\",\n            \"source\": \"MarketBeat\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"MarketBeat\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.949219\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"real_estate\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.839799\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"finance\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.726337\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"earnings\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.722375\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": 0.313658,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"KIM\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.406952\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Bullish\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"BAC\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.613518\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"0.240155\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Somewhat-Bullish\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"Shell, Phillips 66 Test Market for Explorer Pipeline Stake\",\n            \"url\": \"https://eastdaley.com/daley-note/shell-phillips-66-test-market-for-explorer-pipeline-stake\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T080523\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"Keland Rumsey and Jaxson Fryer\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"Shell and Phillips 66 are reportedly exploring the sale of their combined 60.5% stake in Explorer Pipeline, valuing it at approximately $3.5 billion. The pipeline, which transports refined products from the Gulf Coast to the Midcontinent and Midwest, has experienced a decline in performance in 2025 due to reduced throughput and transportation rates. Buyers would need to assess whether the recent dip is temporary or a new trend, considering the potential upside from a diluent expansion and the risks associated with its largest supplier, Motiva.\",\n            \"banner_image\": null,\n            \"source\": \"East Daley Analytics\",\n            \"category_within_source\": \"General\",\n            \"source_domain\": \"East Daley Analytics\",\n            \"topics\": [\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"mergers_and_acquisitions\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.820008\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"energy_transportation\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"topic\": \"financial_markets\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"0.649788\"\n                }\n            ],\n            \"overall_sentiment_score\": -0.149787,\n            \"overall_sentiment_label\": \"Neutral\",\n            \"ticker_sentiment\": [\n                {\n                    \"ticker\": \"PSX\",\n                    \"relevance_score\": \"1.000000\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_score\": \"-0.127538\",\n                    \"ticker_sentiment_label\": \"Neutral\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"title\": \"First Bank & Trust Sells 10,223 Shares of ExxonMobil Corporation $XOM\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/filing-first-bank-trust-sells-10223-shares-of-exxonmobil-corporation-xom-2026-08-11/\",\n            \"time_published\": \"20260811T080517\",\n            \"authors\": [\n                \"MarketBeat\"\n            ],\n            \"summary\": \"First Bank & Trust reduced its stake in ExxonMobil Corporation by 29.9% in the second quarter, selling 10,223 shares and retaining 23,926 shares valued at $3.27 million. Despite this reduction, institutional ownership\",\n  ", "truncated": true, "ts": "2026-08-11T08:27:39.619515+00:00"}
